[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 2.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "his excellency", "start": 5.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Mikail", "start": 8.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Randallin Mana,", "start": 11.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "president of the Foundation of the", "start": 14.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Republic of Madagascar.", "start": 16.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 19.84, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 22.24, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 25.199, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Excellence.", "start": 43.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Excellences,", "start": 46.8, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "President of the United Nations General", "start": 48.399, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 50.48, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 52.48, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "heads of state and government,", "start": 54.559, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "your Excellency, Secretary General of", "start": 59.68, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the United Nations,", "start": 61.359, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, ladies and", "start": 63.68, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 65.439, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "I am particularly proud and honored to", "start": 67.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "address", "start": 71.04, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "this August assembly today", "start": 73.04, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "on behalf", "start": 76.4, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "of the Republic of Madagascar.", "start": 79.52, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "at this 81st session of the United", "start": 83.28, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "Nations General Assembly", "start": 85.439, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "for the rest of my speech.", "start": 94.079, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "Allow me to now speak to you in the", "start": 97.119, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "Malagasi language, my mother tongue,", "start": 100.96, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "in honor of my country and the Malagasi", "start": 105.36, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "people.", "start": 109.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I would like first of all on behalf of", "start": 114.159, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the Malagasi people", "start": 116.88, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "and in my own name to extend my sincere", "start": 119.439, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "congratulations to Mr. Khalur Rakman on", "start": 123.439, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "his election as president of the 81st", "start": 126.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "general assembly as well as to the vice", "start": 128.16, "duration": 5.799}, {"text": "presidents.", "start": 130.959, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "In this regard,", "start": 135.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "I wish to reaffirm Madagascar's support", "start": 137.76, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "and its full readiness to work in a", "start": 141.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "genuine spirit of cooperation to ensure", "start": 146.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "the success of all of our work", "start": 149.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "throughout this session. Mr. President,", "start": 151.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 153.76, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "we must acknowledge that the challenges", "start": 157.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "that we have faced for decades, namely", "start": 160.239, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "food insecurity,", "start": 163.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "disease,", "start": 165.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "armed conflict,", "start": 167.92, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "or natural disasters", "start": 170.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "are still with us.", "start": 173.599, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "Thus for Madagascar,", "start": 176.72, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "as for many other nations,", "start": 180.319, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the new emerging challenges must not", "start": 184.159, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "overshadow the priorities that still", "start": 186.879, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "require our attention.", "start": 189.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The theme of this 81st session calls", "start": 191.76, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "upon us to assume our shared", "start": 195.36, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "responsibility for our destiny and for", "start": 198.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that of future generations with clear", "start": 201.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "vision.", "start": 203.92, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "placing collective action, the common", "start": 205.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "good, and the welfare of humanity at the", "start": 208.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "center of our responses to the profound", "start": 211.2, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "transformations", "start": 213.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "shaping our world. In light of these", "start": 215.599, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "intersecting transformations and", "start": 218.64, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "challenges, the question of trust in our", "start": 220.4, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "collective action arises with renewed", "start": 224.799, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "urgency.", "start": 227.76, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Indeed, we must admit, taking into", "start": 229.92, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "account", "start": 233.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "all the hopes and expectations that we,", "start": 237.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the peoples of the United Nations, have", "start": 240.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "placed in our organization, that trust", "start": 242.64, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "has gradually eroded over time.", "start": 246.0, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The most vulnerable populations", "start": 250.08, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "affected repeatedly or continuously by", "start": 253.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "health crisis, food insecurity and", "start": 256.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "hunger. The impacts of climate change", "start": 259.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and", "start": 262.639, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "conflicts", "start": 264.24, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "exacerbated by current geopolitical", "start": 265.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "tensions sometimes come to feel a", "start": 268.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "certain skepticism", "start": 271.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "regarding our collective capacity within", "start": 273.44, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "the United Nations system to respond to", "start": 276.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the scourges of our age. Mr. President,", "start": 279.919, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 282.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in this regard, the realities on the", "start": 286.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "ground in my country speak for", "start": 289.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "themselves. In southern Madagascar,", "start": 291.12, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "mothers walk dozens of kilometers under", "start": 294.32, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "scorching heat", "start": 297.759, "duration": 3.641}, {"text": "in search of water", "start": 301.44, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "from the bed of a dried up river.", "start": 305.04, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "In the east, every year, increasingly", "start": 309.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "violent and destructive tropical", "start": 312.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "cyclones devastate crops,", "start": 314.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "infrastructure, and human lives.", "start": 317.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "In other regions,", "start": 320.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "floods engulf", "start": 323.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "rice granaries affecting entire", "start": 325.759, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "communities. These images illustrate the", "start": 328.4, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "daily vulnerability of our people, our", "start": 331.759, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Malagasi population. Faced with these", "start": 335.199, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "recurring humanitarian emergencies", "start": 338.639, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "amplified by climate change,", "start": 342.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "considerable investments are made", "start": 345.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "reflecting the unwavering commitment of", "start": 348.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "our development partners", "start": 351.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "working every year towards the", "start": 354.16, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "achievement of the sustainable", "start": 355.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "development goals,", "start": 357.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the SDGs, whether that be fighting", "start": 360.88, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "hunger, providing education, or", "start": 363.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "providing access to basic services for", "start": 365.759, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "vulnerable populations.", "start": 368.0, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "And we hope to mobilize $1.5 billion", "start": 375.919, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "over 5 years for the implementation of", "start": 380.16, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "the United Nations Sustainable", "start": 382.8, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Development Cooperation Framework for", "start": 384.479, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "the period 2024 2028.", "start": 386.8, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Yet beyond commitments and resources", "start": 391.28, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "mobilized,", "start": 394.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "what matters to us is their tangible", "start": 397.52, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "impact on the daily lives of our people.", "start": 400.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Faced with the challenges of a", "start": 403.759, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "constantly changing world, the", "start": 405.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "refoundation government that I lead", "start": 407.919, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "places food sovereignty, health and", "start": 410.4, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "education at the heart of its action.", "start": 413.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "This priority commitment serves the", "start": 416.319, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "entire population, particularly women", "start": 418.479, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and children, while providing our youth", "start": 421.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "with a means to build their future with", "start": 423.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "confidence and contribute to national", "start": 426.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "development. With more than 55% of its", "start": 429.039, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "population under the age of 25,", "start": 432.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Madagascar", "start": 436.56, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "enjoys a tremendous demographic", "start": 438.4, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "dividend.", "start": 440.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Driven by a firm political determination", "start": 442.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "to build a brighter future for this", "start": 444.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "dynamic youth. We recognize the", "start": 447.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "importance of an education system which", "start": 449.52, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "is fully aligned with labor market", "start": 451.759, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "realities, an essential condition for", "start": 453.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "sustainable development. And we hope", "start": 456.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "that cooperation in this area will move", "start": 458.479, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "beyond a strictly quantitative approach", "start": 460.72, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "measured only by the volume of", "start": 463.039, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "infrastructure built or the number of", "start": 464.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "students enrolled and instead adapt", "start": 466.479, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "fully to economic realities on the", "start": 469.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "ground. Our aim is to focus on future", "start": 471.599, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "oriented sectors", "start": 475.36, "duration": 3.559}, {"text": "while redefining our indicators of", "start": 481.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "success to prioritize the practical", "start": 483.84, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "acquisition of skills and medium-term", "start": 486.639, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "employment outcomes.", "start": 490.639, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Mr. President. Excellencies, ladies and", "start": 495.44, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 498.4, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Madagascar's foreign policy is guided", "start": 502.879, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "above all by the imperatives of economic", "start": 505.52, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "and social development for the", "start": 507.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "well-being of its people. Madagascar has", "start": 509.759, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "chosen a policy of engagement in all", "start": 513.12, "duration": 5.399}, {"text": "directions.", "start": 515.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We are open to all international", "start": 519.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "partnerships capable of meeting the", "start": 521.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "aspirations of our people and supporting", "start": 523.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "the general policy of the state of the", "start": 526.32, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "reoundation.", "start": 528.16, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Madagascar's position of neutrality with", "start": 533.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "regard to global conflicts is consistent", "start": 536.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "with its diplomatic tradition and its", "start": 539.6, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "desire to preserve constructive", "start": 542.0, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "relations with all its partners.", "start": 544.08, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "This", "start": 556.88, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "idea", "start": 558.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "is not ideological but is based on", "start": 560.959, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "international partnership that can meet", "start": 564.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the aspirations of our people in an open", "start": 567.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "spirit without exclusivity", "start": 570.8, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "in full respect for ational sovereignty.", "start": 574.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "The achievement of our ambitions cannot", "start": 578.399, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "be separated from the international", "start": 580.399, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "context in which they are pursued.", "start": 582.16, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "Excellencies, Mr. President, ladies and", "start": 587.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 590.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "can we speak of development when", "start": 592.959, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "international peace and security are", "start": 594.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "being tested by multiplying crises", "start": 597.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "around the world and persistent", "start": 600.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "tensions?", "start": 602.08, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Restoring", "start": 604.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "trust requires the United Nations to", "start": 606.56, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "maintain and to restore peace.", "start": 609.519, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "We must be concerned that the", "start": 615.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "multilateral system is struggling to", "start": 617.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "contain escalating tensions fueled by", "start": 620.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalries.", "start": 623.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "These crises", "start": 626.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "now affecting different regions of the", "start": 628.48, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "planet", "start": 630.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "have consequences for our states. They", "start": 634.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "directly impact our economies and the", "start": 637.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "daily lives of our populations through", "start": 640.16, "duration": 7.239}, {"text": "disruptions in energy supply chains", "start": 642.72, "duration": 4.679}, {"text": "and difficulties in the delivery of", "start": 647.519, "duration": 6.361}, {"text": "essential goods.", "start": 650.48, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "These are all factors which further", "start": 654.56, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "aggravate the vulnerabilities that we", "start": 656.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "already face. Confronted with this", "start": 658.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "reality, we must have the courage to", "start": 661.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "recognize and to accept the limitations", "start": 664.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "of the multilateral system in its", "start": 667.279, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "current form and functioning. It is", "start": 669.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "urgent to initiate concerted and lasting", "start": 673.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "action to guarantee every people the", "start": 676.8, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "right to pursue their development in", "start": 680.32, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "dignity and in stability. Mr. President,", "start": 682.959, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 688.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "far from observing the world as a", "start": 691.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "passive spectator, Madagascar positions", "start": 693.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "itself as an actor fully aware of its", "start": 696.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "strategic place and responsibilities.", "start": 698.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Our country remains a committed and", "start": 701.68, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "operational partner in the service of", "start": 703.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "peace, development and security.", "start": 705.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "Maritime security in the Mosambique", "start": 710.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "channel and the western Indian Ocean", "start": 712.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "remains at the heart of the regional", "start": 716.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "initiatives in which Madagascar act", "start": 718.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "actively participates.", "start": 721.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "We are determined to strengthen regional", "start": 724.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and multilateral cooperation founded on", "start": 726.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "respect for national sovereignty.", "start": 729.36, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "whilst also welcoming partnerships that", "start": 736.32, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "align with our priorities and serve as", "start": 738.56, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "genuine drivers of development.", "start": 741.279, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "We also want to be part of strengthened", "start": 748.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "uh regional cooperation in order to", "start": 751.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "guarantee the security of our maritime", "start": 753.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "areas. This approach will make it", "start": 756.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "possible to ensure the sustainability of", "start": 758.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "our energy supply chains. Mr. President,", "start": 761.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen, what", "start": 764.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "form of United Nations cooperation", "start": 767.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "should we establish to support the", "start": 769.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "contemporary transformation of our", "start": 772.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "world? How can we restore trust?", "start": 773.76, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 778.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "we must look to the future with greater", "start": 782.56, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "ambition", "start": 785.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "to ensure lasting and measurable impact", "start": 789.92, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "over the medium and long term. And to do", "start": 793.519, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "this, we must move on to a new stage,", "start": 797.76, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "one of increased solidarity,", "start": 800.32, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "that is more integrated and better", "start": 805.36, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "coordinated.", "start": 807.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Madagascar advocates for a multilateral", "start": 808.639, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "system", "start": 811.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "that is not only capable of acting, but", "start": 812.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "that is also capable of supporting", "start": 815.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "member states in their efforts to break", "start": 818.079, "duration": 9.161}, {"text": "the cycles of poverty and insecurity.", "start": 822.24, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "My country aspires to an international", "start": 828.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "order founded on the primacy of", "start": 830.399, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "international law", "start": 833.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "and trusts in the virtues of dialogue", "start": 837.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and diplomatic action.", "start": 839.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Our commitment to multilateral", "start": 842.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "cooperation remains unwavering.", "start": 844.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Multilateralism is a privileged forum", "start": 847.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "where states unite in a shared", "start": 850.72, "duration": 5.559}, {"text": "responsibility.", "start": 853.279, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "enabling them to define common and", "start": 856.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "appropriate solutions", "start": 859.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "in the face of challenges such as", "start": 862.079, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "epidemics and climate disasters or armed", "start": 863.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "conflicts arising from contemporary", "start": 867.199, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalries and latent", "start": 869.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "multi-dimensional tensions.", "start": 872.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "History and future generations will", "start": 875.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "judge our organization according to a", "start": 877.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "single criterion, namely our ability to", "start": 880.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "fulfill our original mission. serving", "start": 882.88, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "all peoples without exclusion or", "start": 884.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "privilege and in full respect for the", "start": 886.8, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "sovereignty of nations.", "start": 889.36, "duration": 3.719}, {"text": "It is imperative to restore to the", "start": 893.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "United Nations fully its central role as", "start": 896.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "a guardian of peace as a strengthened", "start": 899.839, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "institution capable of restoring order", "start": 903.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and challen and addressing the", "start": 906.32, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "challenges of our time. Excellencies,", "start": 907.92, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 910.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "our challenge today is therefore to", "start": 912.079, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "rethink our mechanisms of cooperation", "start": 915.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "through greater synergy between UN", "start": 918.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "agencies and governmental structures", "start": 920.399, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in order to optimize the effectiveness", "start": 924.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "of our actions on the ground, but also", "start": 927.199, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "to provide better visibility of tangible", "start": 929.519, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "results achieved for the benefit of", "start": 932.399, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "populations.", "start": 934.24, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "In this regard, the success of our", "start": 935.76, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "agenda largely depends on strengthening", "start": 937.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "governance and strengthening", "start": 940.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "institutions priorities that are fully", "start": 942.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "integrated into Madagascar's process of", "start": 944.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "reoundation. We recognize also the", "start": 947.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "absolute necessity of reforming the", "start": 951.12, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "United Nations so that it may serve all", "start": 952.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "peoples. And in this spirit, we would", "start": 954.639, "duration": 6.681}, {"text": "like to propose the following. First,", "start": 956.959, "duration": 4.361}, {"text": "more inclusive global governance.", "start": 962.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "This must begin", "start": 965.92, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "with a rebalancing of decision-making", "start": 968.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "power first and foremost by restoring", "start": 970.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the general assembly's full political", "start": 974.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "weight and central place in global", "start": 976.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "governance. It remains indeed the only", "start": 979.44, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "organ where every nation regardless of", "start": 982.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "power enjoys an equal and sovereign", "start": 986.079, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "voice.", "start": 988.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "We must also", "start": 990.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "correct the historical imbalance", "start": 993.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "affecting Africa's representation on the", "start": 996.079, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "security council.", "start": 999.92, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "Indeed,", "start": 1003.759, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Africa", "start": 1007.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "cannot remain on the margins of", "start": 1009.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "decisions. We have 1.4 billion", "start": 1012.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "inhabitants, decisions concerning", "start": 1014.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "international peace and security.", "start": 1017.199, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Africa should be granted permanent", "start": 1021.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "representation on the security council", "start": 1024.559, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "in accordance with the Ezelwini", "start": 1028.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "consensus and the cert declaration", "start": 1030.959, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "which expresses which express a common", "start": 1034.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "position grounded", "start": 1037.439, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "in justice", "start": 1039.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "equity and", "start": 1042.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "represent representativeness", "start": 1044.959, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "within the African Union. We must also", "start": 1048.0, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "strengthen coherence between programs", "start": 1050.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "implemented by the UN resident", "start": 1052.559, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "coordinator offices and national", "start": 1055.36, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "priorities. UN country teams on the", "start": 1057.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "ground must listen carefully and respond", "start": 1060.559, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "effectively to priorities defined by", "start": 1063.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "host governments, avoiding", "start": 1066.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "one-sizefits-all approaches.", "start": 1068.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Secondly, we need a more accessible", "start": 1071.28, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international financial architecture for", "start": 1072.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "effective development support. We must", "start": 1075.2, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "not neglect the reform of the", "start": 1078.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "international financial architecture.", "start": 1079.679, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "This means we need to rebalance access", "start": 1083.36, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "to financing.", "start": 1085.76, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Current aid and lending criteria", "start": 1089.76, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "often rely solely on GDP per capita,", "start": 1094.16, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "excluding many vulnerable countries. The", "start": 1098.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "United Nations should therefore take", "start": 1101.44, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "into account", "start": 1103.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "the multi-dimensional", "start": 1105.52, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "vulnerability index", "start": 1108.4, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "so that access to concessional financing", "start": 1114.72, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "reflects climate shocks and external", "start": 1122.4, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "debt burdens.", "start": 1124.96, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "It would also be wise to support durable", "start": 1129.76, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "debt relief.", "start": 1132.72, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "This means advocating a for a faster,", "start": 1136.799, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "more predictable and more inclusive", "start": 1140.72, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "sovereign debt restructuring mechanism", "start": 1143.84, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "that would allow vulnerable countries to", "start": 1148.559, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "invest in the sustainable development", "start": 1151.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "goals rather than servicing", "start": 1154.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "unsustainable interest payments.", "start": 1155.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "The procedures for accessing UN funds", "start": 1159.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "should also be drastically simplified in", "start": 1162.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "order to reduce dispersement delays. For", "start": 1164.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "a vulnerable state facing crisis,", "start": 1167.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "administrative", "start": 1170.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "slowness undermines confidence in the", "start": 1171.84, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "effectiveness of multilateralism.", "start": 1175.36, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Third,", "start": 1181.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "greater effectiveness in responding to", "start": 1185.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "climate and humanitarian emergencies.", "start": 1188.4, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "The multilateral system we seek should", "start": 1191.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "guarantee the fulfillment of climate", "start": 1193.679, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "finance commitments.", "start": 1196.96, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "It should serve both as a catalyst and a", "start": 1199.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "guarantor", "start": 1203.12, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "to ensure that developed countries in", "start": 1204.799, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "the north uh honor their commitments on", "start": 1207.2, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "climate finance", "start": 1210.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "particularly for the most exposed", "start": 1213.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "nations. It's also important to link", "start": 1216.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "emergency assistance with long-term", "start": 1218.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "structural investments.", "start": 1220.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1223.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1225.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "by embracing this theme,", "start": 1228.32, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "we are undertaking a commitment,", "start": 1231.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "namely to not postpone the reforms that", "start": 1234.799, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "are essential for enabling our", "start": 1237.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "organization to act with the integrity", "start": 1239.12, "duration": 7.559}, {"text": "required by the challenges of our age.", "start": 1241.919, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Building upon the achievements of the", "start": 1246.88, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "United Nations over 81 years.", "start": 1249.84, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "Our predecessors were able to build an", "start": 1259.039, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "organization suited to their time. It is", "start": 1260.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "now our responsibility to refound it so", "start": 1263.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "that it can address the challenges of", "start": 1266.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "today and tomorrow. Let us pass on to", "start": 1267.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "future generations an organization that", "start": 1270.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "unites, protects, and acts. For its", "start": 1272.08, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "part, Madagascar", "start": 1275.44, "duration": 9.239}, {"text": "is preparing at the national level", "start": 1278.559, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "a framework for the effective", "start": 1285.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "implementation of this transformation", "start": 1286.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "within our means.", "start": 1288.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Indeed, the process of refoundation", "start": 1291.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "initiated following the mobilization of", "start": 1293.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Malagasi youth just one year ago serves", "start": 1295.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "as the foundation for responsible", "start": 1298.88, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "governance supported by strong", "start": 1300.799, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "institutions devoted to the public", "start": 1302.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "interest and having restored citizens", "start": 1304.559, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "trust in the state.", "start": 1306.88, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "This represents a genuine patriotic", "start": 1310.64, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "awakening driven by the deep conviction", "start": 1315.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "that sustainable development requires", "start": 1317.919, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "every citizen to find a full and", "start": 1320.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "meaningful place within the nation. To", "start": 1322.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "give substance to this vision, we have", "start": 1324.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "launched a historic process of inclusive", "start": 1327.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "national dialogue, bringing together all", "start": 1329.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the vital forces of the nation, young", "start": 1332.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "people, women, persons with", "start": 1334.64, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "disabilities, political parties, civil", "start": 1336.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "society, the armed forces, and the", "start": 1340.159, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "private sector.", "start": 1343.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "We have established a clear timetable.", "start": 1346.4, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Our goal is to hold free, transparent,", "start": 1349.36, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "and universally accepted elections", "start": 1352.559, "duration": 6.521}, {"text": "before the end of 2027.", "start": 1355.039, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "Mr. Resident excellencies. Ladies and", "start": 1360.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 1361.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "this platform uh speaking here at this", "start": 1363.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "rostrm also gives me the opportunity to", "start": 1366.08, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "express our gratitude to all our", "start": 1368.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "partners for the trust uh and support", "start": 1369.919, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "that they have provided and", "start": 1373.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "for the fraternal support of the", "start": 1376.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "southern African uh development", "start": 1378.96, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "community SADC and the United Nations uh", "start": 1381.12, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "going with standing with us hand in hand", "start": 1386.32, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "since the beginning of the reoundation", "start": 1388.559, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "process. Long live international", "start": 1390.24, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "cooperation of solidarity. Long live the", "start": 1391.919, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "United Nations. I thank you for your", "start": 1393.679, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "kind attention.", "start": 1395.039, "duration": 3.161}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1399.28, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "thank the president of the Reoundation", "start": 1401.84, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "of the Republic of Madagascar.", "start": 1404.159, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "The assembly", "start": 1410.0, "duration": 2.72}]